The word lists in these files come from ICU4C's break iterator
dictionaries (icu4c/source/data/brkitr/dictionaries/ in the ICU
repository), by way of ICU4X's data generator. thaidict.txt and
khmerdict.txt carry the ICU notice:

    Copyright (C) 2016 and later: Unicode, Inc. and others.
